---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="IT &amp; Tech Parks — Fusionedge">
<div class="cs">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Public+Sans:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&display=swap">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <div class="it-hero">
      <div>
        <span class="cs-tag">IT &amp; Tech Parks</span>
        <h1><span class="it-l">One campus. Every tower, tenant</span> <span class="it-l">and visitor <span class="cs-ul">on one platform.</span></span></h1>
        <p class="cs-lead">Tech parks run like small cities: thousands of employees, dozens of tenants, round-the-clock HVAC, DG sets and lifts, and SLAs that never sleep. FusionEdge brings visitors, desks, maintenance, energy and tenant billing into one live view of the whole campus.</p>
        <div class="cs-btns">
          <a class="cs-btn cs-p" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a Demo <span class="cs-ar">→</span></a>
          <a class="cs-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Talk to Sales</a>
        </div>
        <div class="it-trust"><span>All 26 apps in one plan</span><span>ISO 27001:2022 certified</span><span>Web, mobile and QR</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="it-campus" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a campus operations dashboard">
        <div class="it-cbar">
          <div class="it-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <span class="it-crumb">Campus <i>/</i> <b>Overview</b></span>
          <span class="it-site">All towers ▾</span>
          <span class="it-live">Live</span>
        </div>
        <div class="it-cbody">
          <div class="it-kpis">
            <div><small>Occupancy</small><strong>81%</strong><span class="it-delta g">▲ 3.2%</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 18" preserveAspectRatio="none"><polyline points="0,14 10,12 20,13 30,9 40,10 50,6 60,4" fill="none" stroke="#5D1F72" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            <div><small>Visitors today</small><strong>1,284</strong><span class="it-delta g">▲ 8%</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 18" preserveAspectRatio="none"><polyline points="0,15 10,13 20,10 30,11 40,7 50,5 60,3" fill="none" stroke="#5D1F72" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            <div><small>Open tickets</small><strong>18</strong><span class="it-delta g">▼ 6</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 18" preserveAspectRatio="none"><polyline points="0,4 10,6 20,5 30,9 40,10 50,12 60,14" fill="none" stroke="#00BF88" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            <div><small>SLA met</small><strong>97.6%</strong><span class="it-delta g">▲ 0.8%</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 18" preserveAspectRatio="none"><polyline points="0,10 10,9 20,10 30,7 40,6 50,5 60,4" fill="none" stroke="#00BF88" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          </div>
          <div class="it-table">
            <div class="it-tr it-th"><span>Tower</span><span>Occupancy</span><span>Tickets</span><span>SLA</span></div>
            <div class="it-tr"><span class="it-tn">Tower A</span><span class="it-occ"><em><i style="width:92%"></i></em><b>92%</b></span><span>2</span><span class="g">99.1%</span></div><div class="it-tr"><span class="it-tn">Tower B</span><span class="it-occ"><em><i style="width:78%"></i></em><b>78%</b></span><span>5</span><span class="w">96.4%</span></div><div class="it-tr"><span class="it-tn">Tower C</span><span class="it-occ"><em><i style="width:85%"></i></em><b>85%</b></span><span>3</span><span class="g">98.2%</span></div><div class="it-tr"><span class="it-tn">Tower D</span><span class="it-occ"><em><i style="width:64%"></i></em><b>64%</b></span><span>8</span><span class="w">94.7%</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="it-feed">
            <div class="it-fh"><b>Activity</b><span>Last 30 min</span></div>
            <div><time>10:21</time><span>Ticket #4821 closed with photo proof · AHU-3</span><em class="ok">Closed</em></div>
            <div><time>10:05</time><span>Temperature alert · AHU-3, Tower A</span><em class="wa">Open</em></div>
            <div><time>09:12</time><span>Visitor checked in · Tower B, L4</span><em class="in">Visitor</em></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Challenges -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <section>
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">The challenge</span><h2>Why tech parks are hard to run</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">Every tower has its own vendors, every tenant has its own expectations, and the central team sees most problems only after a complaint.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="it-pains">
        <li><em>01</em><h3>Tenants judge you on SLAs</h3><p>A slow AC fix or a lift outage reaches the tenant’s leadership before it reaches yours. Without timers and escalations, SLAs are tracked in spreadsheets after the fact.</p></li>
        <li><em>02</em><h3>Thousands of people move through every day</h3><p>Employees, visitors, vendors and delivery staff all need fast, secure entry, and security needs a record of who came in, where and when.</p></li>
        <li><em>03</em><h3>Shared power, unclear bills</h3><p>Common-area and after-hours energy is hard to split fairly between tenants when meters are read on paper.</p></li>
        <li><em>04</em><h3>Too many tools, no single view</h3><p>Visitor apps, ticketing, PPM and billing live in separate systems, so the park head has no one place to see how the campus is doing.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- Personas -->
  <div class="cs-tint">
    <div class="cs-w">
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">Built for everyone on campus</span><h2>One platform, three very different users</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">The park operator, the tenants inside the towers, and the people who walk through the gates each get the view they need.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="it-personas">
        <article class="it-p"><span class="it-who">Park operator</span><h3>Run the whole campus from one screen</h3><p>See every tower, asset, ticket and vendor in one place.</p><ul><li>PPM for HVAC, DG sets, lifts and pumps</li><li>SLA timers with automatic escalation</li><li>CXO dashboard across all towers</li></ul></article>
        <article class="it-p"><span class="it-who">Tenants</span><h3>Service you can prove</h3><p>Raise requests, track them live and see exactly what you are billed for.</p><ul><li>Tenant help desk with live status</li><li>Energy and after-hours use by tenant</li><li>Meeting rooms and desks on demand</li></ul></article>
        <article class="it-p"><span class="it-who">Employees &amp; visitors</span><h3>A campus that just works</h3><p>Scan, book and order from a phone. No calls, no queues.</p><ul><li>QR visitor check-in and passes</li><li>Desk and parking booking</li><li>Cafeteria and pantry ordering</li></ul></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modules bento -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <section>
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">Modules</span><h2>Everything a tech park needs, already connected</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">Turn on what you need today and add more later. Every module shares the same assets, people and data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="it-bento">
        <article class="it-m it-w2 it-glow"><span class="mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M2 21a7 7 0 0 1 14 0"/><path d="M17 11l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Visitor Management</h3><p>Pre-registration, QR passes, ID capture and host alerts at every gate and tower lobby, with a full log for security.</p></article>
        <article class="it-m "><span class="mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M8 20h8M12 16v4"/></svg></span><h3>Desk & Room Booking</h3><p>Hot desks and meeting rooms booked from a phone or kiosk.</p></article>
        <article class="it-m "><span class="mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8a2 2 0 0 0 0 4v4h18v-4a2 2 0 0 0 0-4V4H3z"/><path d="M13 4v16"/></svg></span><h3>Smart Ticketing & SLA</h3><p>Every request timed, assigned and escalated automatically.</p></article>
        <article class="it-m "><span class="mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L3 18l3 3 6.3-6.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.5 2.5-2.4-.6-.6-2.4z"/></svg></span><h3>Preventive Maintenance</h3><p>Schedules, reminders and photo proof for every critical asset.</p></article>
        <article class="it-m "><span class="mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z"/></svg></span><h3>Readings & Energy</h3><p>Meters read at set times, with spikes flagged early.</p></article>
        <article class="it-m it-w2 it-glow"><span class="mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 21V7l9-4 9 4v14"/><path d="M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg></span><h3>Tenant Management &amp; Billing</h3><p>Lease details, tenant help desk and after-hours power billed to the right tenant, so common costs are split fairly.</p></article>
        <article class="it-m "><span class="mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V3M7 3v18M17 3c-2 0-3 2-3 5s1 4 3 4v9"/></svg></span><h3>Cafeteria &amp; Shops</h3><p>QR ordering, menus and vendor performance in one place.</p></article>
        <article class="it-m "><span class="mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>CXO Dashboard</h3><p>One live view of every tower, ticket and SLA.</p></article>
        <article class="it-m it-w2 it-img" aria-label="Campus photo">
          <div class="cs-ph it-img-ph"></div>
          <div class="it-img-cap"><span class="it-who">All modules, one platform</span><h3>Built for campuses with many towers and tenants</h3></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- A day on campus -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <section>
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">A day on campus</span><h2>Same campus. Every hour handled.</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">What a normal day looks like when every team works from the same platform.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="it-day">
        <div><time>08:30</time><b>Gates open</b><p>Employees badge in and pre-registered visitors check in with a QR code.</p></div>
        <div><time>10:00</time><b>AC breaks down</b><p>A ticket opens with the asset’s history, and the SLA timer starts.</p></div>
        <div><time>13:00</time><b>Lunch rush</b><p>Cafeteria orders come in by QR, and pantry stock is tracked live.</p></div>
        <div><time>18:00</time><b>Readings taken</b><p>Meters are logged at a fixed time, and energy spikes are flagged.</p></div>
        <div><time>21:00</time><b>After hours</b><p>Late-night power use is measured and billed to the right tenant.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- Security -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <section>
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">Security</span><h2>Security your tenants can trust</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">Tech-park tenants ask hard questions about data. FusionEdge is built to answer them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="it-sec">
        <div><b>ISO 27001:2022</b><span>Certified information security</span></div>
        <div><b>AES-256</b><span>Encryption for your data</span></div>
        <div><b>Two-factor auth</b><span>And role-based access control</span></div>
        <div><b>WAF &amp; DDoS</b><span>Protection, logging and monitoring</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <div class="cs-cta">
      <span class="cs-tag" style="color:#e6d6ee">Get Started</span>
      <h2 style="margin-top:14px;max-width:24ch">See FusionEdge running on a campus like yours</h2>
      <p>Book a demo and we will walk you through the modules for your towers, tenants and visitors. No card and no setup fee.</p>
      <div class="cs-btns">
        <a class="cs-btn cs-g" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a Demo <span class="cs-ar">→</span></a>
        <a class="cs-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Contact Sales</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.cs{
  --bg:#fff;--soft:#f4eff7;--ink:#1b1530;--mut:#6c6780;--line:#ebe6f0;--card:#fff;
  --brand:#5D1F72;--green:#00BF88;--green-ink:#00a576;--ph:#ece7f0;--phx:#9a91a6;
  --r:16px;--sec:clamp(72px,10vw,120px);color-scheme:light
}
.cs,.cs *{box-sizing:border-box}
.cs{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif;line-height:1.6;width:100%}
.cs,.cs *,.cs *::before,.cs *::after{font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif!important}
.cs h1,.cs h2,.cs h3,.cs p{margin:0}
.cs h1,.cs h2,.cs h3{color:var(--ink)}
.cs-w{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,40px)}

/* Type — italic display headings like the main site */
.cs h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5.2vw,60px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;font-style:italic}
.cs h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:600;font-style:italic;text-wrap:balance}
.cs h3{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand)}
.cs-lead{font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,17px);color:var(--mut);line-height:1.7}
.cs-ul{color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--green);text-decoration-thickness:3px;text-underline-offset:8px}

/* Bits */
.cs-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand)}
.cs-tag::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}
.cs-pill{font-size:12.5px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:99px;background:#fff;color:var(--brand);border:1px solid #dccde6}
.cs-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cs-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:99px;font:600 14px/1 "Public Sans",sans-serif;
  border:1px solid #d9cfe2;background:#fff;color:var(--brand);text-decoration:none;transition:transform .15s,background .15s,border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.cs-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:var(--brand)}
.cs-btn.cs-p,.cs-btn.cs-g{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-color:var(--brand)}
.cs-btn.cs-p:hover,.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(93,31,114,.25)}
.cs-btn .cs-ar{transition:transform .15s}.cs-btn:hover .cs-ar{transform:translateX(3px)}

.cs-ph{background:var(--ph);color:var(--phx);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden}
.cs-ph::before{content:"Image"}

/* Hero */
.cs-hero{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,104px) 0 0;text-align:center}
.cs-hero h1{margin:0 auto;white-space:nowrap}
.cs-hero .cs-sub{font-size:clamp(15px,2.2vw,21px);font-weight:600;font-style:italic;margin:18px auto 0;white-space:nowrap}
.cs-hero .cs-lead{max-width:780px;margin:16px auto 32px;text-wrap:balance}
.cs-hero .cs-btns{justify-content:center}
.cs-checks{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:40px auto 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;max-width:1040px;text-align:left}
.cs-checks li{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink);padding:16px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(93,31,114,.05)}
.cs-checks li::before{content:"✓";flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center}
.cs-hero-img{aspect-ratio:16/7;margin-top:clamp(40px,6vw,64px);border-radius:24px}
@media (max-width:640px){.cs-hero .cs-sub{white-space:normal;max-width:30ch}}
@media (max-width:480px){.cs-hero h1{white-space:normal;max-width:12ch}}

/* Stats */
.cs-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin:clamp(48px,7vw,80px) 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.cs-stats div{padding:28px clamp(16px,2.5vw,32px)}
.cs-stats div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
.cs-stats b{display:block;font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,48px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;color:var(--green-ink)}
.cs-stats span{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:10px}

/* Sections */
.cs section{margin-top:var(--sec)}
.cs-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(20px,5vw,80px);align-items:end;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,4vw,48px)}
.cs-head h2{margin-top:14px}

.cs-grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px)}
.cs-grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px)}
.cs-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;background:var(--card);display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(93,31,114,.06);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.cs-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 16px 36px rgba(93,31,114,.12)}
.cs-card .cs-ph{border-radius:0;aspect-ratio:16/10}
.cs-grid2 .cs-card .cs-ph{aspect-ratio:16/8}
.cs-card .cs-b{padding:22px 22px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.cs-card p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.65}
.cs-card .cs-n{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green-ink);letter-spacing:.04em}

/* Purple band */
.cs-band{margin-top:var(--sec);background:var(--brand);color:#fff;padding:clamp(56px,8vw,96px) 0;text-align:center}
.cs-band h2{color:#fff}
.cs-band p{margin:14px auto 0;max-width:640px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,17px);color:#e6d6ee}

/* Feature rows */
.cs-feat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(32px,6vw,88px);align-items:center}
.cs-feat.cs-rev{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.05fr)}
.cs-feat.cs-rev .cs-ph{order:2}
.cs-feat .cs-ph{aspect-ratio:5/4;border-radius:24px}
.cs-feat .cs-t{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}
.cs-feat .cs-t p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.75}
.cs-tags{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}
.cs-chips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px}
.cs-chip{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(93,31,114,.05)}
.cs-chip b{display:block;font-size:20px;color:var(--green-ink);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:2px}

/* Lavender section */
.cs-tint{background:var(--soft);margin-top:var(--sec);padding:var(--sec) 0}
.cs-tint section{margin-top:0}

/* CTA */
.cs-cta{margin:var(--sec) 0 clamp(56px,8vw,96px);background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-radius:24px;text-align:center;
  padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,4vw,48px)}
.cs-cta h2{max-width:20ch;margin:0 auto;color:#fff}
.cs-cta p{max-width:560px;margin:16px auto 32px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,17px);color:#e6d6ee}
.cs-cta .cs-btns{justify-content:center}
.cs-cta .cs-btn.cs-g{background:#fff;color:var(--brand);border-color:#fff}
.cs-cta .cs-btn:not(.cs-g){background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4)}
.cs-cta .cs-btn:not(.cs-g):hover{border-color:#fff}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width:960px){.cs-checks{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.cs-grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media (max-width:760px){
  .cs-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .cs-stats div:nth-child(3){border-left:0}
  .cs-stats div:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .cs-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}
  .cs-feat,.cs-feat.cs-rev{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}
  .cs-feat.cs-rev .cs-ph{order:0}
  .cs-hero-img{aspect-ratio:4/3}
}
@media (max-width:560px){.cs-checks,.cs-grid3,.cs-grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cs-btns .cs-btn{flex:1 1 auto}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.cs *{transition:none!important}}

/* Button colours locked so global link styles can't override them */
.cs a.cs-btn,.cs a.cs-btn:visited{color:var(--brand)!important;text-decoration:none!important}
.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p:visited,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p:hover,
.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g:visited,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{color:#fff!important}
